3. Main features whose modules are listed in section 1 (Toyota Corolla Cross Hybrid): end-of-stop force control and
   brake delivery trim, experimental-mode stop anchoring, creep and stall handling, lead braking assistance,
   mid-speed brake handling, stop gap closing and holding, night gap, sticky radar lead, EV glide, slope cruise,
   cruise smoothing, low-speed lane centering, straight mode and low-speed straight hold, highway plan curvature,
   lateral torque split, pitch compensation, engage-close stop handling, door lock above 10 km/h, speed dial and
   lane change HUD, and the tn_autoupdate / tn_iowatch tools.

